{camdjan} just looks like a name to me as well. I don't know how well names
like "Farmer John" carry over, especially since (according to jbofihe) LA
BRIVLA CMEVLA isn't grammatical. (So {la <brivla for farmer> djan} is not
allowed.) Technically all cmevla are like this, though it is hard to look at
{la camgusmis} and not think of "robin".

mu'o mi'e .latros.

